window.products.push({"id":724090,"name":"Storage for China, Hard Shell China Storage Containers Service for 12(Khaki)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sXsAk4URL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"STORAGE CONTAINER FOR CHINA : This set of plate storage is made of durable woven fabric that can protect your plates with quality. The 4-Piece China Storage Set is also stylish since you can see every stitching detail design and trim on the cases. These cases are soft, plush, and durable which makes ideal choices to have for your dishes. PROTECT YOUR PRECIOUS CHINA: Forge about dropping and breaking your plates when you go out, this dinnerware storage container is here to help. The set has 4 dish storage containers, one of each can hold up to 12 plates with dividers and separators inside. With the separation of each plate like this, they will stay safe and unbroken no matter where you go. READY TO SHINE ON SPECIAL OCCASIONS: Easy and convenient storage before or after casual or formal settings, Thanksgiving, Christmas Holidays, ideal china storage bags for precious china dinnerware, china dishes , saucers and salad Plates. The china storage set is also perfect for housewarming, hostess, or bridal gift. CHINA STORAGE CONTAINERS SERVICE FOR 12: 12\" Dinner Plate Case (for up to 12 dinner plates), 10\" Salad Plate Case (for up to 12 salad plates), 8.5\" Dessert Plate Case (for up to 12 dessert plates), 7\" Saucer Plate Case (for up to 12 saucers). Each case includes a content label window to insert your own label to quickly identify contents inside. PLATE SEPARATORS INCLUDED: our china storage cases come with full size felt separators to prevent each plate from cracks and scratches. No more clanking sound when moving your plates.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sXsAk4URL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Landrip","source_asin":"B08H86TPNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H86TPNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H86TPNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
