window.products.push({"id":724296,"name":"OstepDecor Couch Cover, Sofa Cover, Quilted Sectional Couch Covers, Velvet Sofa Slipcover for Dogs Cats Pet Love Seat Recliner Leather L Shaped, Armre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KBtWafoGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"WHAT SIZE SHOULD I ORDER? Please MEASURE your furniture prior to purchasing. Each piece of furniture is unique and we want you to be thrilled with the fit. You can find a detailed size guide below: Sofa, Loveseat & Chair Size: 1. 28\" Width Series fits for sofa width equal or less than 24\". Refer to length, please add extra 4\" - 8\" longer than actual sofa length.2. 36\" Width Series fits for sofa width between 24\" to 32\". Refer to length, please add extra 4\" - 8\" longer than actual sofa length.3. 43\" Width Series fits for sofa width above 32\". Refer to length, please add extra 4\" - 8\" longer than actual sofa length. Armrest Size Reference: Two sizes for choice: 28\" x 28\", 36\" x 36\", please measure and choose suitable size to match. Backrest Size Reference: Backrest width below 32\", recommend folding the 28\" x 28\" rectangular cover to trianglular shape shown in the picture.Backrest width below 32\", recommend folding the 36\" x 36\" rectangular cover to trianglular shape shown in the picture. CAN I USE THIS ON LEATHER FURNITURE? Our slip-resistant protector works great on both fabric and leather furniture. However, because leather furniture does have a smoother surface, you may find that additional adjustments may be necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KBtWafoGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OstepDecor","source_asin":"B01LX6E960","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LX6E960","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LX6E960","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":724297,"name":"Dulles Glass Modern Round Frameless Mirror - 42'' inch, 1/4\" Thick Beveled Glass with Hooks for Wall Mount","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IWD2xsSFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Add depth and spaciousness to a room with a mirror created by dulls glass & mirror. This 42-inch round mirror features a carefully crafted 1-inch polished bevel . Two hooks allow the mirror to be fastened to drywall, studs, or wood. This beveled mirror has its edge carefully cut and polished with a 1-inch angle, thin on the outer edge, then increasing gradually for one inch. When attached to the wall via the provided clips the outer surface of the mirror sits about 1/2\" from the wall. Safety features this mirror has a safety backing. This means that if your mirror breaks, it will not shatter and leave dangerous broken glass. Instead, the mirror glass remains adhered to the safety backing. How to hang your mirror your mirror will arrive with two hooks that are each 3 1/2\" square. Each has a cross-like opening. Before hanging your mirror, you need two measurements-the distance from the center of one cross to the center of the other, and the distance from the highest part of the mirror to the top of the crosses. You then find the spot on the wall where you want to hang your mirror, keeping in mind its diameter. Mark the spot where you want the top of the mirror to be. Then measure down from that to the point that is the distance from the highest part of the mirror to the top of the crosses. From that point mark to the left and right the distance from the center of one cross to the center of the other , with half on one side and half on the other. These two locations are where you put the screws.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IWD2xsSFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dulles Glass","source_asin":"B006TJSHAQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006TJSHAQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006TJSHAQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
