window.products.push({"id":724395,"name":"YANGNAY 20 Pack Glass Jars with Bamboo Lids, Spice Tea Herb Storage Containers, Stackable, 2 Size (6 oz, 8 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fmn806+hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"20 PACK FOOD STORAGE CONTAINERS: Each set includes 20 pack glass jars with bamboo lids. 20 small glass jars can help you to store a lot of food and make your kitchen cleaner. DURABLE: These glass jars are very thick and not easy to wear. The bamboo lids are durable. Perfect for storing coffee, tea, spice, snacks, candy, etc. Clear glass jars can showcase items better. You could also use labels to mark the stored foods and the dates. KEEP FRESH: There is a silicone ring on the bamboo lid of our glass jar. When you close the lid, you can feel the pressure of the air and hear the sound of air-tightness. Each glass jar could be placed in the fridge to keep the stored food fresh. EASY TO CLEAN: All our glass jars are easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Small sized containers can be stacked so that your time and space could be saved. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: We will use a thick protective box to ensure that the glass jars will reach you in perfect condition. If damage occurs during transportation, please contact us. You will get a satisfying solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fmn806+hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YANGNAY","source_asin":"B09BHYVVTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BHYVVTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BHYVVTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":724396,"name":"New Eva-Dry E-333 Dehumidifier Protects Gun Safe, Boat, RV from Humidity & Moisture by GOEASY0312","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51glNc3FbvL._AC_SL1059_.jpg","description":"Safes provide the perfect environment for mold as they are dark, musty, and often times humid. Now imagine being able to leave your safe for 6-8 weeks at a time, knowing full well that all your moisture is being sucked out of the air. This is exactly what our friends over at Eva-Dry were thinking when they came up with the E333 Dehumidifier. It's so simple, you just hang the Eva-Dry in any enclosed space and the moisture is absorbed automatically, with no batteries to replace or cords to plug in. There is an indicator window with special \"moisture meter crystals\" that change from orange (when dry) to green (when wet) to indicate when the unit needs to be renewed. The unit will absorb approximately six ounces of moisture (depending on humidity levels, this should take between six to eight weeks). Once the moisture has been adsorbed, it cannot leak or spill. This unit uses a specially engineered crystallized silica gel that is odorless, non-toxic and completely safe  When the indicator crystals turn green, it is time to recharge the unit. Simply plug it into a power outlet or power strip in a well ventilated area (bathroom with extraction fan, garage, outside, etc.). There is a built-in heater that will warm the crystals allowing them to expand and release the moisture as water vapor into the outside air. It takes about 12 to 14 hours to completely recharge the unit. When it is completely renewed, the indicator crystals will change back to orange. The unit is again ready to absorb more moisture. Specifications for the Eva-Dry E333 Wireless Dehumidifier No batteries No cord Absorbs moisture Renewable 5\" h x 6\" w x 1-1/2\" d","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51glNc3FbvL._AC_SL1059_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOEASY0312","source_asin":"B06XBG1FZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XBG1FZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XBG1FZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
