window.products.push({"id":724643,"name":"HLC.ME Lattice Print Blackout Darkening French Door Curtain Panel - Thermal Insulation Provides Energy Efficiency and Privacy for Sidelight Doors - 1 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dCc2-yyRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The doors, they are so irritating, how do I decorate them and block the cold and sunlight? Blackout curtains are a necessity for privacy. Doors are really hard to deal with. You cant hang an ordinary curtain on them because that just makes no sense. The curtains will tangle on the hinges when you open and close the door. SOLUTION: Use a french door panel. They are neat, fine looking, and alleviate the decor of the room. There are times when darkening a room aids in sleep, especially for shift workers or others with non traditional sleep schedules, and for blocking artificial night time light such as from a streetlamp entering through your master bedroom doors. Benefits of blackout curtains: Energy efficient: They can decrease the amount of money spent on heating and air conditioning because of the curtain's ability to reduce the amount of heat lost in cooler months and reflect heat in the summer. Sunlight: These blackout curtains are made of tightly woven, dense fabric inter sewn into a triple weave technology to reduce unwanted sunlight. These curtains will stop light from passing through thanks to special treatments and extra tight woven fabrics to help you control the light levels in your room. Creative Design: A moroccan geometric pattern offers a pleasing accent for any window. A lattice pattern interwoven to complete a chic and versatile look to compliment any room. Privacy: If you've ever been kept awake by irritating little noises from the street below that pull you back from the edge of blissful sleep, you'll appreciate the noise reduction abilities of our blackout drapes. The thick blackout fabric of our readymade blackout curtains helps to dampen noises, contributing further to the peaceful sanctuary you need when you are drifting off to sleep. MACHINE WASHABLE: Machine Wash Cold, delicate cycle with mild detergent. Do not bleach. Tumble Dry Low. Cool iron if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dCc2-yyRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HLC.ME","source_asin":"B084CVC8XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084CVC8XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084CVC8XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
