window.products.push({"id":724708,"name":"Stainless Steel Kitchen Tongs, Set of 3-7,9,12 Inch,Non-Stick Food Tongs with Silicone Tips for Barbeque, Cooking, Grilling Turner(multi color - Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pV5xCPeHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to operate: 1.Plug the power cord into a standard 220V AC electrical outlet. 2.Press “ON/OFF” button, the product is working on 1200W, the three red lights on. 3.Press “MOD” button to change the heating/cooling setting - fan only(three blue lights), warm(one red light), hot(three red light) 4.Press “TURN” button, the heater will turn automatically with an angle about 70℃ 5.Press “+” or “-” button, setting the temperature you need. Maintenance and Storing: 1. Always be sure that the appliance is switched OFF before cleaning or attempting to store the item. Do not immerse heater in water or allow water to drip into the interior of the heater, as this could create an electric shock hazard. 2. Allow the product to completely cool before handling or cleaning it. Ensure the heat select knob is in the shut down position and the power cord is unplugged from the electrical outlet before cleaning the product. Warning: 1. If it is too hot, do not cover the heater. 2. When the heater is working, do not touch the metal grid (vent) to avoid burns. 3.DO NOT block the air inlet and keep it at least 3 feet from the wall or other objects the distance. 4. Don't use it in an uneven place because it is easy to automatically power off. For example: soft carpet, soft bed, uneven ground, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pV5xCPeHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cnacnoo","source_asin":"B0785J7P3T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0785J7P3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0785J7P3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":724709,"name":"Totally Bamboo California State Shaped Cutting Board and Charcuterie Serving Platter with Artwork by Fish Kiss, Includes Hang Tie for Wall Display","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MQj2E7HzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Celebrate Life in The Golden State: features a beautifully illustrated map by Fish Kiss, see if you can find your home town A Fun Charcuterie Board: serve on the brightly-colored board and talk with friends and family about memories of your favorite places Wonderful for Wall Art: the included hang tie allows the board to easily double as decor in your kitchen, dining room or den; board measures 14-1/4\" x 11\" x 5/8\" All the Benefits of Bamboo: flip the board over to its blank back side to use as a knife-friendly bamboo cutting board for food prep Great for Gifting: a perfect gift for anyone on your list that loves California; give as a present for birthdays, housewarming, Christmas, Mother's Day and more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MQj2E7HzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B0B22SQ11H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B22SQ11H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B22SQ11H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
