window.products.push({"id":724711,"name":"Luxe Faux Fur Throw Blanket 50 x 60 Inch | Fuzzy Blanket with Plush Faux Fur Pile and Soft Fleece Back | Machine Washable Warm Fluffy Blanket for Bed ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DdieZCFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FAUX FUR THROW BLANKET: Indulge in the luxurious feel of faux fur when wrapped up in this soft throw blanket on chilly evenings or cold mornings. Style this plush blanket on your couch, bed, or armchair to add elegance to your space while delighting in soft texture. 100% CRUELTY-FREE FABRICS: Our faux fur throw is designed to mimic the weight and feel of an authentic sheepskin blanket without using real animal fur during any stage of the manufacturing process. This luxe throw is made from 80% Plush Acrylic and 20% sturdy Polyester. LUXURIOUS FLEECE BACKING: A micro-fleece on the reverse side of this luxurious throw blanket keeps any minimal shedding from faux fur strands off your outfit. The incredibly soft back of this blanket will have you snug and cozy for hours. BEAUTIFUL SIZE AND COLOR: Our throw blankets come in a variety of colors and patterns to fit your home. Our throws come in 2 sizes and feature 20 beautiful faux fur options that include leopard prints, faux mink, and natural rabbit depending on the look you desire. EASY CLEANING AND CARE: For your convenience, our throw blankets can be washed in your machine on a gentle cycle or handwashed if you prefer. We recommend line drying to preserve the longevity of our luxuriously soft throw blankets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DdieZCFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luxe L 100% Faux Fur","source_asin":"B07TSQM645","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TSQM645","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TSQM645","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":724712,"name":"Kikkerland Stay Fresh Bag | Potato","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31LAoXtwkZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Love fresh ingredients but tired of them going bad before you have time to use them? Grab up the Stay Fresh Potatoes Bag. This bag is designed with a drawstring closure to help keep potatoes fresh for longer and features a trendy pop art design along the front. Made from easy to clean, BPA-free, polyester, this bag is able to hold up to 8lbs of potatoes! Grab up one for your house today and stretch the lifespan of your potatoes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31LAoXtwkZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kikkerland","source_asin":"B07JN4SPVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JN4SPVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JN4SPVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":724713,"name":"FireBeauty Fireplace Screen 3 Panel Wrought Iron Black Metal 48\"(L) x30(H) Spark Guard Cover (Classic)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SWPlng3ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CLASSIC TIMELESS DESIGN:3 panel screen arched top almost matches with your fireplace tools and holders accessories. SPARK GUARD: Durable screen can completely block popping embers, keep your kids & puppies away from the fireplace & safeguard the living room safety. OVERALL DIMENSIONS: We use 26mm more durable pipe and diamond curlicue design to fit our diamond serious deisign fireplace tools.48\"(L) x 30\"(H),black powder-coated finish. FOLDABLE FIREPLACE SCREEN: This 3 panel screen can be manipulated to your preference for the perfect setup in front of your fireplace and folded down for easy storage in compact spaces.No assembly required. EASY TO CLEAN: Keeping the screen looking its best is a breeze, as the easy-to-clean material helps to prevent rust buildup and maintain its appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SWPlng3ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fire Beauty","source_asin":"B08FRPBRJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FRPBRJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FRPBRJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":724714,"name":"Ancient Cookware, Traditional Colombian Chamba Clay Soup Bowl, 24 Ounces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eZ9XSsajL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Traditional Clay Soup bowl in black clay from Colombia with the accompanying wicker basket. Length 7.7in (handles included), Width 6.5in (from outside), Height 3.3in (without the basket), Diameter 5.75in and Capacity 24oz (filled comfortably without overflowing). Since they are oven, gas or electric stovetop and microwave safe, perform great for au gratin soups with a stunning presentation. Completely natural and safe, contains no toxins or lead and the porous nature of the clay allows the slow evaporation of steam and produce food that is healthier, tastier, and moist using less fat and liquids. Will last many years with proper use and care (each piece comes with a product information sheet outlining the Uses and Care for the product). Black Clay, Chamba Cookware, is well-known and used throughout Colombia in restaurants and homes for preparing and serving traditional dishes. Its origins can be traced back at least 700 years to vases and pitchers found in pre-Columbian archaeological sites. It is still made in the traditional manner, by families in a small village on the banks of the Magdalena River in Central Colombia. Each piece is hand-made using local area clays, then hand burnished with a stone. The pieces are then fired in the village, giving them the distinctive black color and elegant look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eZ9XSsajL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ancient Cookware","source_asin":"B008CJWHBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008CJWHBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008CJWHBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
