window.products.push({"id":724729,"name":"OXO Good Grips Angled Turkey Baster with Cleaning Brush & Good Grips 2 Cup Fat Separator","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DFsnlRUhL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"OXO Good Grips Angled Turkey Baster with Cleaning BrushThe OXO Good Grips Angled Baster with Cleaning Brush is a great tool for basting big birds. The angled tip is ideal for reaching into pans and ovens without burning your hands. The round silicone bulb is comfortable to hold and squeeze at any angle and the bold measurement markings are easy to read. The Angled Baster’s integrated stand prevents rolling while minimizing drips. The Baster bulb and tip remove for quick cleaning with the included Brush. All parts are top-rack dishwasher safe.OXO Good Grips 2 Cup Fat SeparatorMaking gravy has never been easier with the OXO Good Grips Fat Separator. Simply place the stopper in the spout and when you pour pan drippings into the fat separator, the strainer will separate unwanted bits and the fat will rise to the top. Remove the stopper and pour, and the flavorful cooking liquid will come out first, allowing you to leave the fat behind. The measurement markings make following recipes simple, and the splatter shield helps prevent splashing while you pour. When you’re done, this Separator is dishwasher safe, and there is a built-in storage spot in the strainer to keep the stopper so it doesn’t get lost. Available in 2-Cup and 4-Cup sizes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DFsnlRUhL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B0BM32M8FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM32M8FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM32M8FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
