window.products.push({"id":724743,"name":"Aetegit 2 Pack Total 60 LEDs 29.5 FT Fall String Lights Thanksgiving Fall Decor,Fall Decorations for Home,Battery Powered Maple Leaf Garland Wreath In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yljQwmrvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍁【2 Pack Maple Leaves LED String Lights Fall Decorations for Home】🍁 The package includes 2 Pack Total 29.52FT/60 Led Maple leaves Lights(14.76FT/PCS, 30 LED Maple leaves/PCS). In the daytime, it will serve as a string of maples leaves to decorate your home. At night, when it on, it will make your home more bright and warm for any occasion.Led lights and Maple leaves are waterproof, but the battery case isn't. Please put the battery box in a covered area for indoor or outdoor decoration. 🍁【Maple Leaves Lights Fall Decor for Thanksgiving&Halloween】🍁 This Fall garland decor set is with 60 fall leaves to serve as Fall decorations, Autumn decor, Thanksgiving decorations, Halloween decorations. They are the unique indoor outdoor decorations suitable for Fall parties, birthday parties, Harvest celebrations, Thanksgiving Day, Halloween, Valentine's Day, weddings, Christmas, or any occasion that matches the theme of the festival. 🍁【LED Fall Maple Leaves Lights Apply to Multiple Places】🍁 The fall garland lights features autumn-colored leaves, providing a gorgeous and impressive display to your home. You can wrap them around on Fall wreath, doors, door frame, doorway, stair banisters, windows, table top, mantel, fireplace, courtyard or any other space at home to creating a rich and elegant look. 🍁【2 Modes & 3 AA Battery Operated Fall Decorations Lights】🍁 The maple leaves garland LED string lights have 2 mode, Steady on/Flashing, making your home warm and joyful on Fall/thanksgiving/Halloween/Christmas festival.Battery operated string lights are powered by 3 AA battery (Not include). Compared with 2AA battery powered lights, it is low power consumption and supports longer continuous light up. No plug required thus you can decorate and hang anywhere. 🍁【Premium Material Made Maple Leaves LED String Lights】: Every maple leaf is with the texture of real maple leaves, making it looks very realistic.The leaves and wire of LED lights are made of premium plastic material, which make it durable and reusable. You can bend it to any shape or wrap it on anything you want. If you have any problem, please feel free to find us for help. We will provide you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yljQwmrvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aetegit","source_asin":"B0999BR9JF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0999BR9JF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0999BR9JF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
