window.products.push({"id":724831,"name":"4500 Sq. Ft 70 Pint Dehumidifier Basement, Home Dehumidifier With Drain Hose And Oversized Water Tank, 24 Hour Timer And Automatic Defrost For Medium ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qpi6w8ysL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Efficient Dehumidification】(2012 DOE Standard) The HUMSURE Safety Dehumidifier can remove up to 70 pints of water every 24 hours. If you want a large dehumidifier with drain hose for garage, bathroom, bedroom, living room, basement, kitchen, this 70 pint dehumidifier is definitely a no-brainer. 【Negative Ion Washable Filter, Smart Control Panel】The control panel of this home dehumidifier has a simple design with information buttons, including drying for stronger dehumidification, humidity for custom settings, A timer and an ionizer to purify the air in the room are healthier and more environmentally friendly. Easy-to-clean washable filters: Capture airborne dust and keep your dehumidifier working efficiently with our easy-to-clean washable filters 【Portable, Ultra-Silent Work】This dehumidifier is not only a home dehumidifier for the basement, but also an ideal dehumidifier for the bedroom. Combined with a high-efficiency compressor and fan (3 speeds), the dehumidifier operates with less than 48dB of noise in sleep mode, ensuring you won't be disturbed while resting, while ensuring efficient results. Portable Design: Easily move from room to room with casters and side handles to dehumidify your room anytime, anywhere. 【Automatic shutdown design, automatic defrost】 Whole house dehumidifier will automatically shut down when the water tank is full, with a buzzer alarm and the FULL indicator light solid red. The self-protecting design prevents this dehumidifier from leaking and damaging, ensuring its outstanding performance for a longer lifespan. The automatic defrost function prevents the collected water from freezing and damaging the machine. 【Simple drainage】: After the water tank of the garage household dehumidifier is full, the drainage can be taken out. Another option is to use the included drain hose for continuous draining, which saves even more time and effort on frequent emptying. Just use a hose to connect the continuous drain hole to a floor drain or collection container. 【After-sales Warranty】Our home silent dehumidifiers come with a 12-month warranty from the date of purchase, so if you have any initial defects or other issues, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qpi6w8ysL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUMSURE","source_asin":"B0B7767DVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7767DVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7767DVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
