window.products.push({"id":724882,"name":"Gelmaza Bamboo Ziplock Bag Organizer for Kitchen Drawer, Food Storage Baggie Organizer Wall Mount, Sandwich Snack Bag Organizer, Plastic Bag Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FWecHDbdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make the Drawer Organized - Are you still bothered by the messy food storage bags in your kitchen? The ziplock bag organizer can help you organize the messy food-storage plastic bags by category, keep your kitchen neat and organized. The box size is: 13.3 x 12 x 2.8 inches (L×W×H), make sure that you measure the height of your drawers first before you purchase this. Premium Natural Bamboo - Ziplock organizer for drawer made of natural bamboo, and each box having a laser engraved logo and polished finish. With smooth surface and edges, allowing you to easily put in or take out the plastic ziplock bags without scratching your hands. Easy to clean, You just need to wipe it with a cloth, do not soak it in water. Wall-Mounted Design - You could lift the top open to load the ziploc bags easier. There is a latch to keep it closed, so the bag will not expand and pop out like a magnet lid. There are two holes on the back of the bamboo baggie storage box, you can hung it on the wall or placed in a drawer. (Includes screws) Compatible With Most Brands - This food storage bag box has 5 compartment. Compatible with Ziploc, Solimo, Hefty, Glad & GreatValue storage, freezer and slider bags. Easily fit Gallon, Snack, Sandwich, and Quart sized storage bags, including 8\" wide Quart bags. No Assembling is Needed - Our handcrafted plastic bag organizer for drawer comes fully assembled, so you don't have to install it again. Considering the customer feedback that the box marked \"Quart\" does not fit quart sized bags, Gelmaza optimizes the length of Quart box to be longer than other.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FWecHDbdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gelmaza","source_asin":"B09ZTGCFYP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZTGCFYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZTGCFYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
