window.products.push({"id":724893,"name":"30 Piece Silverware Set with Tray, PERHOME Eating Utensils Sets Service for 6, Stainless Steel Flatware Set, Flatware Cutlery Set for Kitchen, Restaur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619yLs0P5GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality Stainless Steel Material】: This silverware set is made of high quality food grade stainless steel, rust-proof, healthy, safe, high hardness and sturdy, non-toxic, BPA free, no metal aftertaste, will not produce like other materials residue or odor, long life. At the same time, its sturdiness ensures that it will not bend easily, giving you long-term use. Smooth edges without any rough marks keep your lips safe. 【30 Pieces Silverware Set Service for 6】: This 30 pieces eating utensils sets with silverware organizer, it comes with 6 knives, 6 forks, 6 spoons, 6 salad/dessert forks and 6 dessert/tea spoons, plus 1 durable plastic cutlery organizer for easy sorting of your cutlery, suitable for a family of 4, a must for home or restaurant. The set is also an irreplaceable dining tool, whether for everyday use or preparing dinners or parties. 【Elegant Design and Exquisite Workmanship】: High mirror polishing and classic shape design make this stainless steel flatware set look very noble, smooth edge without a trace of rough spots, will not hurt your mouth, the dinner knifes design with a sharp serrated blade, you can cut the steak easily and comfortably. This cutlery set fits all your furniture styles and complements any of your cutlery, enhancing your dining experience with an elegant silverware set. 【Use and Care】: This stainless steel tableware set is super easy to clean and maintain, while being dishwasher safe. Care instructions: For best results, do not allow the kitchen utensil set to soak for extended periods of time. Hand washing is recommended first, do not use a wire brush, hard sponge, cleaning cloth or any other hard cleaning tool for cleaning. After use, please clean and dry thoroughly to ensure its durability. Dry in time after washing to avoid damage to flatware. 【Service Policy】: We have a very efficient after-sales service team, if you have any questions or dissatisfaction with our silverware sets, please feel free to contact us, we will provide the best quality service to help you. If you don't like the product, please contact us and we promise an unconditional refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619yLs0P5GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PERHOME","source_asin":"B0B9KXYP6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9KXYP6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9KXYP6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
