window.products.push({"id":724969,"name":"N-Image Digital Touch Screen Food Thermometer Meat Thermometer/Timer with Alarm, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y2fp-P1zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Simple Design Makes Cooking That Whole Lot Easier We all know how important it is to cook our food for the right duration, unfortunately many of us, especially as we grow older find it hard to keep track of how long a piece of meat has been cooking for, and low and behold, before we know it the whole thing is smoking. Now with this thermometer, you can cook the food under your prederence. The Best Digital Food Thermometer For Your Needs The Touchscreen Kitchen thermometer is attractive looking and easy to use to prevent such catastrophes from happening. The product is made of high quality hard plastic. The alarm is easy to hear in another room but not too loud to be deafening. You have two choices for placement, either use the magnets on the back to attach to a oven door or pull back the retractable stand and have it sit on any flat surface. This probe thermometer comes with suggested cooking temperatures for several different meats, poultry and fish. You won't need to look up the cooking temperature with the pre-set temperatures.Timer can count up and down so can be used as a stopwatch as well as a countdown timer, ideal for cooking food,homework. Product Features Touch screen operation.Default to Fahrenheit.Set your cooking preference. WELL DONE, MEDIUM, MEDIUM RARE, RARE.Select cooks. Beef, veal, pork,fish, ham,chicken,lamb, turkey.Magnetic backing and retractable stand.  Countdown and count up timer. Demensions 85x85x24 millimeters; 1 meter cable for the probe. Two AAA batteries (Not included). Guarantee/Warranty 60 days, no questions asked, full money back guarantee 1 year warranty for defects","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y2fp-P1zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N-Image","source_asin":"B01CLDEK4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-724969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CLDEK4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CLDEK4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
